        "normalsImported": 3,
        "vertexColorEnabled": true,
        "note": "The rigid case is carried in full: normals, tangent basis, factors, maps and colour all arrive, and the colour multiplies base colour. The residue is a SKINNED vertex-coloured primitive, which keeps SkinnedEffect and its normals but not the metallic-roughness material; GLTF-463 owns the stride that would carry it."
      },
